From cd7279a16530b59fe8e9524246087d87c440478b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Agus Rachman <agus.rachman@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:59:22 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Add draft UK packs (gb, gb-eaw, gb-sct, gb-nir) and evals

- packs/gb (UK-wide, 46 entries): Companies Act 2006 execution (ss 43-47)
  and governance, LLPs and overseas companies, UK GDPR and the Data (Use
  and Access) Act 2025, National Insurance, NHS and other identifiers,
  legislation.gov.uk, Find Case Law, OSCOLA 5th edn
- packs/gb-eaw (29): individuals' deeds (LP(MP)A 1989), Mercury signing,
  land contracts, guarantees, CPR time rules, Limitation Act 1980, the
  judicial AI guidance, Ayinde, PD 57AC and the CJC final report of
  29 October 2026 (recommendations, not yet rules)
- packs/gb-sct (25): Requirements of Writing (Scotland) Act 1995,
  counterparts, electronic documents, prescription, Scottish bank
  holidays and report citations
- packs/gb-nir (22): 2005 Order deeds, Statute of Frauds (Ireland) 1695,
  Limitation (Northern Ireland) Order 1989, Northern Ireland bank holidays
- Bank holiday tables for 2026-2027 and seed CPR rules are pending
  verification, so the deadline script fails closed
- Router resolves UK labels to gb plus gb-eaw, gb-sct or gb-nir; "UK"
  alone loads gb only; Irish law is not Northern Ireland
- Ten UK eval cases, eight trigger prompts, four fixtures, two script
  tests; skill descriptions, README, CODEOWNERS and eval docs name the UK

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MoX2CD8e32TheN9ftqzoZp
