+spelling: en-GB
+terms:
+- use: claimant / claim form / particulars of claim
+  instead_of: plaintiff / writ / statement of claim
+  note: Civil Procedure Rules since 1999.
+- use: King's Bench Division (KB)
+  instead_of: Queen's Bench Division (for decisions after 8 September 2022)
+  note: Neutral citations use (KB) from that date.
+- use: executed as a deed
+  instead_of: signed, sealed and delivered (for individuals)
+  note: Sealing by individuals was abolished in 1990.
+- use: Stamp Duty Land Tax (England) / Land Transaction Tax (Wales)
+  instead_of: stamp duty (on land)
+  note: Wales has had its own tax since April 2018.
+- use: Senedd Cymru
+  instead_of: Welsh Assembly
+  note: Renamed in 2020; its Acts apply in Wales only.
